00:16:49.113 --> 00:16:51.336
really get into the learning.

00:16:53.087 --> 00:16:53.933
- Yeah, and the summer camp you mentioned,

00:16:53.933 --> 00:16:55.823
it was a digital summer
camp and so you were able

00:16:55.823 --> 00:17:00.793
