take the course challenge
on the get-ready-for

00:19:27.493 --> 00:19:30.153
grade level course, if you do well go

00:19:30.153 --> 00:19:32.043
into the grade level course
learn that at your own time

00:19:32.043 --> 00:19:34.153
and pace, if you didn't do so well, focus

00:19:34.153 --> 00:19:35.553
on the get-ready-for grade level course

00:19:35.553 --> 00:19:37.973
so you have a strong foundation.

00:19:37.973 --> 00:19:41.573
Anything to add maybe Dan to that?

00:19:41.573 --> 00:19:44.103
- Yes, I would just say
