to look at the Khan
Academy advocate program,

00:32:48.743 --> 00:32:51.443
the advocates are the
volunteers who've been doing

00:32:51.443 --> 00:32:52.973
these various translation projects.

00:32:52.973 --> 00:32:56.303
So depending what region,
what language in Africa

00:32:56.303 --> 00:32:59.863
