00:32:59.863 --> 00:33:03.113
to translate or to redo Khan
Academy in that geography.

00:33:03.113 --> 00:33:05.613
And there are all different
levels of fidelity depending

00:33:05.613 --> 00:33:06.763
on where they are in that journey

00:33:06.763 --> 00:33:08.073
and how well resourced they are.

00:33:08.073 --> 00:33:10.153
And if you don't see your
language and wanted to see it,

00:33:10.153 --> 00:33:11.913
maybe you could be one of the advocates

00:33:11.913 --> 00:33:14.603
or you can find a group of
folks who can start that effort

00:33:14.603 --> 00:33:16.826
in your geography in your language.

00:33:18.263 --> 00:33:23.263
So let's see, from this is
a question from Facebook,

